  "definition": "Insurers Use of Unlicensed Adjusters Prohibited",
  "effectiveDate": "2015-10-26",
  "historyNote": "#1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5649, eff 7-1-93; ss and moved by #6999, eff 5-24-99 (from Ins 1001.09), EXPIRED: 5-24-07 New. #8900, eff 7-1-07 (formerly Ins 1001.13), EXPIRED: 7-1-15 New. #10962, eff 10-26-15",
